<title>USA: May Dept files for $500 mln shelf debt.</title>
<headline>May Dept files for $500 mln shelf debt.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>May Department Stores Co filed a shelf registration Friday with the Securities and Exchange Commission for up to $500 million in debt securities.</p>
<p>Net proceeds will be used to retire a portion of its outstanding commercial paper and other short-term debt, finance operations and for general corporate purposes, including stock repurchases, investments or possible acquisitions, the company said.</p>
<p>No underwriters were listed in the filing.</p>
</text>
